"Covetous" monsters, including Rodney, care about getting certain
shiny unique items *more* than they care about killing you. In the
case of the Amulet itself,
if the Wizard pays you a visit in Moloch's sanctum, he will ignore you
and attack the High Priest instead. He will turn his attention to you
*only* after he acquires the Amulet from the priest's dead carcass.

Because Rodney wants the Bell of Opening, I *think* that if the Bell
of Opening lies somewhere else on the level, and you aren't carrying
the other invocation items, he may similarly turn his attention to the
Bell before harming you. I AM NOT SURE OF THIS. Check via Wizmode.


